        ["kafka"] =
        [
            "The Kafka broker answers the Apache Kafka wire protocol (ApiVersions, Metadata, SaslHandshake, SaslAuthenticate, Produce, Fetch, ListOffsets, InitProducerId, CreateTopics, the consumer-group requests and OffsetCommit, OffsetFetch) for `kafka` and `kafkas` listen URLs. It is an extended server (see the extended topic): it is judged by the Apache Kafka protocol guide (https://kafka.apache.org/protocol), not by upstream curl, which has no `kafka` scheme.",
